    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d8cbc8fd8da9edc",
      "translationZh": "在许可条款方面，Llama 3.2 的许可证与 Llama 3.1 非常相似，但可接受使用政策中有一项关键区别：任何居住在欧盟的个人，或主要营业地点位于欧盟的公司，均未被授予使用 Llama 3.2 所含多模态模型的许可权利。这项限制不适用于包含此类多模态模型的产品或服务的最终用户，因此，人们仍然可以使用视觉版本构建面向全球的产品。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a13356bba32e08f",
      "translationZh": "如需了解完整详情，请务必阅读官方许可证和可接受使用政策。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d102521162ec86a6",
      "translationZh": "Llama 3.2 1B 和 3B 有什么特别之处？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0bf6d8e28c079226",
      "translationZh": "Llama 3.2 系列包含 1B 和 3B 文本模型。这些模型专为设备端使用场景设计，例如提示词改写、多语言知识检索、摘要任务、工具使用，以及在本地运行的助手。它们的表现优于许多同等规模的开放访问模型，并能与规模大出数倍的模型竞争。在后面的章节中，我们将向你展示如何离线运行这些模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2feb960456c88f7",
      "translationZh": "这些模型采用与 Llama 3.1 相同的架构。它们使用多达 9 万亿个 token 进行训练，并且仍然支持 128k 个 token 的长上下文长度。这些模型具备多语言能力，支持英语、德语、法语、意大利语、葡萄牙语、印地语、西班牙语和泰语。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45bac3a11055a075",
      "translationZh": "此外，还有一个新的小型 Llama Guard 版本，即 Llama Guard 3 1B，可以与这些模型一起部署，用于评估多轮对话中用户或助手的最后回复。它使用一组预定义类别，这些类别可以根据开发者的使用场景进行自定义或排除（这是此版本新增的功能）。有关 Llama Guard 使用方法的更多详情，请参阅模型卡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "736a982e1cb9c49d",
      "translationZh": "额外提示：除了上文提到的 8 种受支持语言，Llama 3.2 还接触过更广泛的语言。我们鼓励开发者针对特定语言使用场景对 Llama 3.2 模型进行微调。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f819091bfa10280",
      "translationZh": "我们使用 Open LLM Leaderboard 评测套件对基础模型进行了评测，同时使用三个热门基准对指令模型进行了评测：IFEval、AlpacaEval 和 MixEval-Hard。这些基准衡量指令遵循能力，并且与 LMSYS Chatbot Arena 的评测结果具有较高的相关性。以下是基础模型的结果，其中也列出了 Llama-3.1-8B 作为参考：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86f708fe647d3133",
      "translationZh": "MATH 难度等级 5",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b38ae2c5b84529e8",
      "translationZh": "平均值",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02c1723e9c7675e3",
      "translationZh": "以下是指令模型的结果，其中包含 Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct 作为参考：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0125",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b38ae2c5b84529e8",
      "translationZh": "平均值",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0141",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b29715692db91034",
      "translationZh": "值得注意的是，3B 模型在 IFEval 上的表现与 8B 模型一样强！这使得该模型非常适合智能体应用，在这类应用中，遵循指令对于提高可靠性至关重要。对于这种规模的模型来说，如此高的 IFEval 分数令人印象深刻。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0142",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9c8d92783683865",
      "translationZh": "1B 和 3B 指令微调模型都支持工具使用。工具由用户在零样本设置下指定（模型事先并不了解开发者将使用的工具）。因此，Llama 3.1 模型中内置的工具（brave_search 和 wolfram_alpha）不再可用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0143",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "844bf7dc0f76cbc5",
      "translationZh": "由于规模较小，这些小模型可以充当更大模型的助手，执行辅助生成（也称为推测解码）。这里有一个使用 Llama 3.2 1B 模型作为 Llama 3.1 8B 模型助手的示例。对于离线使用场景，请查看本文后面的设备端部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0144",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8a2cc0673b1c4283",
      "translationZh": "演示",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0145",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c1bda76606bbac97",
      "translationZh": "你可以在以下演示中试用这三个 Instruct 模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0146",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9b8e61b1f045d01f",
      "translationZh": "搭载 Llama 3.2 11B Vision Instruct 的 Gradio Space",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0147",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ff2be222332c2beb",
      "translationZh": "由 Gradio 驱动、搭载 Llama 3.2 3B 的 Space",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0148",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6fb46eac21e9204a",
      "translationZh": "在 WebGPU 上运行的 Llama 3.2 3B",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0149",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b77e1b3558ea91fb",
      "translationZh": "由 MLC Web-LLM 驱动的 WebGPU Llama 3.2 3B",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0150",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9fd1fde4deefa809",
      "translationZh": "使用 Hugging Face Transformers",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0151",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1a49e854f8a8f28",
      "translationZh": "纯文本模型检查点的架构与先前版本相同，因此无需更新你的环境。不过，由于采用了新架构，Llama 3.2 Vision 需要更新 Transformers。请确保将已安装的版本升级至 4.45.0 或更高版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0152",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97051d83ea0cc791",
      "translationZh": "升级后，你就可以使用新的 Llama 3.2 模型，并利用 Hugging Face 生态系统中的所有工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0153",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1398adc67bab4426",
      "translationZh": "Llama 3.2 1B & 3B 语言模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0154",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3daaa09685f62971",
      "translationZh": "使用 Transformers，只需几行代码即可运行 1B 和 3B 文本模型的检查点。这些模型检查点以 bfloat16 精度上传，但你也可以使用 float16 或量化权重。内存需求取决于模型大小和权重精度。下表展示了不同配置下进行推理所需的大致内存：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0155",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bcae6c15f396f43a",
      "translationZh": "模型大小",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0167",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "772d904c64b71737",
      "translationZh": "有几个细节：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0168",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b25d64042bc924ec",
      "translationZh": "我们以 bfloat16 加载模型。如上所述，这是 Meta 发布的原始检查点所使用的数据类型，因此，为确保最佳精度或进行评估，建议采用这种方式运行。根据你的硬件情况，float16 可能会更快。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0169",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5b3c1f79f7b756a",
      "translationZh": "默认情况下，transformers 使用与原始 meta 代码库相同的采样参数（temperature=0.6 和 top_p=0.9）。我们尚未进行广泛测试，欢迎自行探索！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0170",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f66ed57eb5c8c47c",
      "translationZh": "Llama 3.2 视觉",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0171",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ada628dfb812f440",
      "translationZh": "Vision 模型更大，因此运行时所需的内存比小型文本模型更多。作为参考，11B Vision 模型在 4-bit 模式下进行推理时，约占用 10 GB 的 GPU 显存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0172",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d39e538e862f121f",
      "translationZh": "使用经过指令微调的 Llama Vision 模型进行推理，最简单的方法是使用内置的聊天模板。输入通过 user 和 assistant 角色来标示对话轮次。与文本模型相比，一个区别是它不支持 system 角色。用户轮次可以包含图文输入或纯文本输入。要表明输入包含图像，请在输入的 content 部分添加 {\"type\": \"image\"}，然后将图像数据传递给处理器：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0173",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a979af8287a44ada",
      "translationZh": "你可以继续围绕这张图像展开对话。不过请记住，如果你在新的用户轮次中提供了一张新图像，模型从那一刻起就会以新图像为参照。你不能同时询问两张不同图像的相关内容。下面是延续此前对话的一个示例，我们将助手轮次添加到对话中，并询问更多细节：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0174",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0c236f3aa43684d",
      "translationZh": "这是我们得到的回复：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0175",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd55bc21450d5b91",
      "translationZh": "你也可以使用 bitsandbytes 库自动量化模型，以 8-bit 甚至 4-bit 模式加载。以下是以 4-bit 加载生成流水线的方法：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0176",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25a5f8efc448a199",
      "translationZh": "然后，你就可以像之前一样应用聊天模板、使用处理器并调用模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0177",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e624a8787b45a298",
      "translationZh": "设备端",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0178",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3bb865d089278ab2",
      "translationZh": "你可以使用以下几种开源库，直接在设备的 CPU/ GPU/ Browser 上运行 Llama 3.2 1B 和 3B。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0179",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "30ff3a850b3c7a16",
      "translationZh": "Llama.cpp 与 Llama-cpp-python",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0180",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c200513ee38c302",
      "translationZh": "Llama.cpp 是跨平台设备端机器学习推理的首选框架。我们在这个集合中为 1B 和 3B 模型都提供了量化后的 4-bit 和 8-bit 权重。我们期待社区积极采用这些模型，并创建更多量化版本和微调版本。你可以在这里找到所有量化后的 Llama 3.2 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0181",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d59c47218687675",
      "translationZh": "下面介绍如何直接通过 llama.cpp 使用这些检查点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0182",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe1679f2356a8088",
      "translationZh": "通过 brew 安装 llama.cpp（适用于 Mac 和 Linux）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0183",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2904020ad1b5006a",
      "translationZh": "你可以使用 CLI 运行一次生成，或启动 llama.cpp 服务器，该服务器兼容 Open AI 消息规范。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0184",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a702a46b569b11a7",
      "translationZh": "你可以使用类似下面的命令运行 CLI：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0185",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ec140655213f531",
      "translationZh": "你可以像这样启动服务器：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0186",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2dca537694dde140",
      "translationZh": "你也可以使用 llama-cpp-python 在 Python 中以编程方式访问这些模型。使用以下命令，通过 Pip 从 PyPI 安装该库：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0187",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7c554d925284137",
      "translationZh": "然后，你可以按如下方式运行模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0189",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c08580cf6752d4f6",
      "translationZh": "你甚至可以使用 Transformers.js 在浏览器中（或任何 JavaScript 运行时，例如 Node.js、Deno 或 Bun）运行 Llama 3.2。你可以在 Hub 上找到 ONNX 模型。如果你尚未安装该库，可以使用以下命令从 NPM 安装：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0190",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7c554d925284137",
      "translationZh": "然后，你可以按如下方式运行模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0191",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4a028c1e7523022",
      "translationZh": "示例输出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0193",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42fb4522ce99449d",
      "translationZh": "MLC.ai Web-LLM 是一个高性能的浏览器内 LLM 推理引擎，借助硬件加速将语言模型推理直接带到网页浏览器中。所有操作都在浏览器内运行，无需服务器支持，并通过 WebGPU 加速。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0194",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71b84a3454c3a358",
      "translationZh": "WebLLM 与 OpenAI API 完全兼容。也就是说，你可以在本地对任何开源模型使用相同的 OpenAI API，支持的功能包括流式输出、JSON-mode、function-calling 等。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0195",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb0be66fa9a2db3f",
      "translationZh": "你可以通过 npm 安装 Web-LLM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0196",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7c554d925284137",
      "translationZh": "然后，你可以按如下方式运行模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0197",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8117d1beb240d1e3",
      "translationZh": "成功初始化引擎后，你就可以通过 engine.chat.completions 接口，使用 OpenAI 风格的聊天 API 调用聊天补全功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0198",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7f384a86376c3737",
      "translationZh": "微调 Llama 3.2",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0199",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1526fe044c5505a",
      "translationZh": "TRL 开箱即支持使用 Llama 3.2 文本模型进行聊天和微调：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0200",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5796fc214438ec7f",
      "translationZh": "TRL 也提供对 Llama 3.2 Vision 微调的支持，可使用此脚本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0201",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da8f723b935ab925",
      "translationZh": "你也可以查看这个 notebook，了解如何使用 transformers 和 PEFT 进行 LoRA 微调。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0202",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bb2b1fc903ec2341",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face 合作伙伴集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0203",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "37591589ffe44d6d",
      "translationZh": "我们目前正与 AWS、Google Cloud、Microsoft Azure 和 DELL 的合作伙伴携手，将 Llama 3.2 11B、90B 添加到 Amazon SageMaker、Google Kubernetes Engine、Vertex AI Model Catalog、Azure AI Studio、DELL Enterprise Hub。容器可用后，我们会立即更新本节，你也可以订阅 Hugging Squad 以获取电子邮件更新。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0204",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9459e12f91695e9b",
      "translationZh": "更多资源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0205",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c86a0119d5e288ef",
      "translationZh": "Hub 上的模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0206",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4fedca0b4fe2daf2",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Llama 实践指南",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0207",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1db6b82b94f9e058",
      "translationZh": "开放大语言模型排行榜",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0208",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c7b5b3da2e664b12",
      "translationZh": "Meta 博客",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0209",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "37df90b2e35d2231",
      "translationZh": "评估数据集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0210",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c9015d53b9084645",
      "translationZh": "致谢",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0211",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "476d94c9fa75b127",
      "translationZh": "如果没有数千名社区成员为 transformers、text-generation-inference、vllm、pytorch、LM Eval Harness 以及许多其他项目作出的贡献，就不可能在生态系统中发布这些模型并提供相应的支持和评估。感谢 VLLM 团队帮助测试和报告问题。本次发布离不开以下所有人的支持：Clémentine、Alina、Elie 和 Loubna 在大语言模型评估方面的支持；Nicolas Patry、Olivier Dehaene 和 Daniël de Kok 在 Text Generation Inference 方面的支持；Lysandre、Arthur、Pavel、Edward Beeching、Amy、Benjamin、Joao、Pablo、Raushan Turganbay、Matthew Carrigan 和 Joshua Lochner 对 transformers、transformers.js、TRL 和 PEFT 的支持；Nathan Sarrazin 和 Victor 让 Llama 3.2 在 Hugging Chat 中可用；Brigitte Tousignant 和 Florent Daudens 在宣传沟通方面的支持；以及 Hub 团队的 Julien、Simon、Pierric、Eliott、Lucain、Alvaro、Caleb 和 Mishig 为此次发布进行的 Hub 开发和功能建设。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0212",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5bf7064c5f4ca77",
      "translationZh": "也非常感谢 Meta 团队发布 Llama 3.2，并将其提供给开放 AI 社区！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "open-weight models",
      "briefZh": "开放权重模型",
      "explanationZh": "公开提供模型权重的模型；开放权重并不必然意味着所有相关代码和数据均开源。"
    },
    {
      "term": "multimodal",
      "briefZh": "多模态",
      "explanationZh": "指模型能够处理文本、图像等多种类型的信息。"
    },
    {
      "term": "instruction-tuned",
      "briefZh": "指令微调",
      "explanationZh": "指经过指令数据微调，使模型更善于遵循用户指令。"
    },
    {
      "term": "on-device",
      "briefZh": "设备端运行",
      "explanationZh": "指模型直接在本地设备上运行，而非依赖远程服务器。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Model checkpoints",
      "briefZh": "模型检查点",
      "explanationZh": "训练过程中保存的模型状态，可用于加载模型、推理或继续训练。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Inference",
      "briefZh": "推理",
      "explanationZh": "使用已训练的模型处理输入并生成输出的过程。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Fine-tuning",
      "briefZh": "微调",
      "explanationZh": "在已有模型基础上进一步训练，以适配特定任务或数据。"
    },
    {
      "term": "license changes",
      "briefZh": "许可证变更",
      "explanationZh": "指模型许可证条款的调整，可能涉及使用和分发权限。"
    },
    {
      "term": "1B",
      "briefZh": "十亿参数",
      "explanationZh": "模型规模标识，表示约十亿个参数。"
    },
    {
      "term": "3B",
      "briefZh": "三十亿参数",
      "explanationZh": "模型规模标识，表示约三十亿个参数。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Language Models",
      "briefZh": "语言模型",
      "explanationZh": "用于处理和生成自然语言文本的模型。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Partner Integrations",
      "briefZh": "合作伙伴集成",
      "explanationZh": "指与合作伙伴提供的工具、平台或服务进行集成。"
    },
    {
      "term": "multimodal model",
      "briefZh": "多模态模型",
      "explanationZh": "能够处理不同类型输入的模型，此处涉及文本和图像。"
    },
    {
      "term": "visual reasoning",
      "briefZh": "视觉推理",
      "explanationZh": "根据图像中的信息进行分析并得出结论。"
    },
    {
      "term": "grounding",
      "briefZh": "视觉定位",
      "explanationZh": "将语言描述与图像中的具体对象或区域对应起来。"
    },
    {
      "term": "document question answering",
      "briefZh": "文档问答",
      "explanationZh": "根据文档内容回答问题的任务。"
    },
    {
      "term": "image-text retrieval",
      "briefZh": "图文检索",
      "explanationZh": "根据文本检索相关图像，或根据图像检索相关文本。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Chain of Thought (CoT)",
      "briefZh": "思维链",
      "explanationZh": "通过分步骤的推理过程形成回答的方法。"
    },
    {
      "term": "image-text prompting",
      "briefZh": "图文提示",
      "explanationZh": "同时使用图像和文本作为模型的提示输入。"
    },
    {
      "term": "text-only prompting",
      "briefZh": "纯文本提示",
      "explanationZh": "仅使用文本而不包含图像的提示方式。"
    },
    {
      "term": "vision tower",
      "briefZh": "视觉塔",
      "explanationZh": "模型中负责提取图像视觉特征的组件。"
    },
    {
      "term": "image adapter",
      "briefZh": "图像适配器",
      "explanationZh": "用于将图像特征与语言模型衔接的组件。"
    },
    {
      "term": "frozen",
      "briefZh": "冻结参数",
      "explanationZh": "指训练过程中不更新文本模型的参数，以保留其原有能力。"
    },
    {
      "term": "document reasoning",
      "briefZh": "文档推理",
      "explanationZh": "指基于文档内容进行分析并推导答案的能力。"
    }
  ],
